{"id":"24bf838911cb0003","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-canonical-funcs.md","title":"Canonical Functions modulo Club","display":"thm-canonical-funcs — Canonical Functions modulo Club","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-canonical-funcs","aliases":["58-thm-canonical-funcs"],"display":"thm-canonical-funcs — Canonical Functions modulo Club","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-canonical-funcs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-canonical-funcs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-canonical-funcs — Canonical Functions modulo Club"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is a regular uncountable cardinal.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}funcs\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S(f,g,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf,g\\in\\kappa^\\kappa\n\\land\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(f(\\xi)&lt;g(\\xi))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}funcs\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S(f,g,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf,g\\in\\kappa^\\kappa\n\\land\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(f(\\xi)&lt;g(\\xi))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}funcs}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\n\\exists F:(\\kappa^+)\\to\\kappa^\\kappa\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\kappa^+\\;\n\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S(F(\\alpha),F(\\beta),\\kappa),\\\\\n\\forall g\\in\\kappa^\\kappa\\;\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa^+\\;\n\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S(g,F(\\alpha),\\kappa)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}funcs}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\n\\exists F:(\\kappa^+)\\to\\kappa^\\kappa\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\kappa^+\\;\n\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S(F(\\alpha),F(\\beta),\\kappa),\\\\\n\\forall g\\in\\kappa^\\kappa\\;\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\kappa^+\\;\n\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S(g,F(\\alpha),\\kappa)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sequence is increasing and cofinal modulo the club filter; pointwise domination or equality on a club would be a different claim.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}funcs\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S(f,g,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf,g\\in\\kappa^\\kappa\n\\land\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(f(\\xi)<g(\\xi))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}funcs}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\n\\to\n\\exists F:(\\kappa^+)\\to\\kappa^\\kappa\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall\\alpha<\\beta<\\kappa^+\\;\n\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S(F(\\alpha),F(\\beta),\\kappa),\\\\\n\\forall g\\in\\kappa^\\kappa\\;\\exists\\alpha<\\kappa^+\\;\n\\mathrm{LessOnClub}_S(g,F(\\alpha),\\kappa)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1400,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4064","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-canonical-funcs.md|58-thm-canonical-funcs]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["04670bdc8b64b8dd","36d7463d215be751","0fbfc19800246e77"]}